        <mxCell id="constraint_payments" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;payments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PRIMARY KEY · payments_pkey&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PRIMARY KEY (id)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FOREIGN KEY · fk_payments_booking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FOREIGN KEY (booking_id) REFERENCES bookings (id) | DELETE CASCADE | UPDATE NO ACTION&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UNIQUE · uq_payments_booking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;UNIQUE (booking_id)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK · ck_payments_amount&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHECK (amount &amp;gt;= 0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK · ck_payments_method&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHECK (method IN (&amp;#x27;BANK_TRANSFER&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK · ck_payments_received_amount&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHECK (received_amount &amp;gt;= 0 AND received_amount &amp;lt;= amount)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK · ck_payments_status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHECK (status IN (&amp;#x27;UNPAID&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;PAID&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;CANCELLED&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;INDEX · idx_payments_paid_at&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;btree (paid_at) WHERE status = &amp;#x27;PAID&amp;#x27;" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#7E22CE;fillColor=#F3E8FF;fontColor=#111827;">
